#: ../developer/code-structure.md:3
msgid ""
"This guide explains where behavior belongs and how to follow it through "
"the repository. Use [development.md](development.md) for setup and "
"checks, and [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for service and security "
"boundaries."
msgstr ""
"这份指南讲各类行为该放在哪里，以及怎样在仓库里顺藤摸瓜找到它们。环境搭建和检查看 "
"[development.md](development.md)，服务边界和安全边界看 [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:7
msgid "Start with the deployment boundary"
msgstr "先看部署边界"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:24
msgid ""
"The control plane and host are independently deployed implementations. "
"Neither imports the other. Shared code provides the facts and contracts "
"they agree on; it imports neither implementation. Gateway integration "
"uses HTTP contracts. The agent database and Gateway database remain "
"separate."
msgstr ""
"控制平面和主机端是分开部署的两套实现，谁也不导入谁。共用代码只放双方都认可的事实和契约，本身也不导入任何一方的实现。和网关之间通过 HTTP "
"契约对接。Agent 数据库和网关数据库始终是分开的。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:29
msgid "Follow a control-plane request"
msgstr "跟着一个控制平面请求走"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:45
msgid ""
"`app.py` mounts the owner/admin API and the separate MCP-only listener. "
"It installs shared HTTP response and exception policies, and on both "
"listeners a dependency that runs ahead of every route's own "
"(`api/_parameters.py`): a path or query parameter holding NUL, or a "
"route's integer parameter too wide for a `bigint`, is refused with a 422 "
"before any query reads it. So is a JSON body holding NUL or half a "
"surrogate pair, on a route an owner, an administrator or the on-call "
"relay calls; host and sandbox reports keep their own models, which "
"replace those characters instead. `bootstrap/lifespan.py` constructs the "
"resources and starts and stops background work; route modules do not own "
"service startup or shutdown."
msgstr ""
"`app.py` 挂载所有者/管理员 API 和单独的 MCP 专用监听器，并装上统一的 HTTP "
"响应和异常处理策略。两个监听器上还都装了一个依赖，它排在每个路由自己的依赖之前（`api/_parameters.py`）：路径或查询参数里带 "
"NUL，或者路由的整数参数超出了 `bigint` 的范围，都会在任何查询读到它之前直接返回 "
"422。由所有者、管理员或值班中继调用的路由，JSON 请求体里带 NUL "
"或者只有半个代理对，也一样拒绝；主机和沙箱的上报有自己的模型，会把这些字符替换掉，而不是拒绝。`bootstrap/lifespan.py` "
"负责创建资源，以及启动、停止后台任务；服务的启动和关闭不归路由模块管。"

