#: ../developer/code-structure.md:71
msgid ""
"The storage assembly exposes capabilities such as `store.host_pool` and "
"`store.pending_messages`. Callers type against the capabilities they use."
" They do not import Postgres repositories or reach through the assembly "
"to its pool. Application flows may use the existing FastAPI exception "
"contracts; moving files does not imply those interfaces have become "
"framework-independent."
msgstr ""
"存储组装对外提供 `store.host_pool`、`store.pending_messages` "
"这样的能力。调用方的类型只针对自己用到的能力来写，既不导入 Postgres "
"repository，也不绕过组装直接去拿它的连接池。应用流程可以沿用现有的 FastAPI "
"异常约定；文件挪了位置，并不代表这些接口已经和框架脱钩。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:77
msgid ""
"MCP session ownership lives in `mcp/runtime.py`: lazy host construction, "
"fenced session reaping, maintenance, and closing. Both the relay's "
"handlers and bootstrap call that runtime directly. Eager send-now handoff"
" task retention and cancellation live in `application/send_now.py`; the "
"durable delivery rows and recovery worker still own crash recovery."
msgstr ""
"MCP 会话归 `mcp/runtime.py` 管：按需创建 host、带栅栏的会话回收、日常维护和关闭。中继的处理函数和 bootstrap "
"都直接调用这个运行时。立即发送（send-now）交接任务的保留和取消在 "
"`application/send_now.py`；崩溃恢复仍然靠持久化的投递记录和恢复 worker。"

