#: ../developer/code-structure.md:106
msgid ""
"`runner.py` owns claims, attempt leases, turn execution, heartbeats, and "
"draining. `claimed_job.py` defines claim payloads and lease errors; "
"`control_plane_client.py` owns attempt-scoped worker HTTP calls, request "
"deadlines, and event replay. The runner explicitly re-exports their "
"existing public names and keeps client construction at its orchestration "
"boundary."
msgstr ""
"`runner.py` 负责认领任务、attempt 租约、执行轮次、心跳和排空。`claimed_job.py` "
"定义认领的数据结构和租约错误；`control_plane_client.py` 负责以 attempt 为范围的 worker HTTP "
"调用、请求超时和事件重放。runner 会显式地把这两个模块原有的公开名称再导出一遍，客户端的创建仍留在 runner 的编排层。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:112
msgid ""
"`chat_sandbox_models.py` holds retained-container specs, "
"inspection/status values, ownership labels, and identity bounds. Group "
"bridges, relay membership, Kata guest route synchronization, and network "
"proof/release live in the composed `chat_sandbox_network.py` component. "
"It consumes a narrow container protocol; exact container identity, "
"bounded exec, and fail-stop operations stay with the manager. Existing "
"manager network entry points delegate to that owner. Network snapshots "
"remain scoped to one operation, and operational log names are stable. "
"`chat_sandbox.py` manages retained groups and their members; `sandbox.py`"
" owns the container/process boundary. The Sandbox Manager and session "
"supervisor coordinate native sessions and workspace operations. The "
"supervisor's metadata lock protects in-memory ownership only. Stop, "
"orphan recovery, and archive deletion reserve one group's lifecycle "
"before Docker or marker I/O, then revalidate its group, member, "
"container, and lifecycle identities before accepting the result. Other "
"groups remain available; failed checks release their temporary "
"reservation, while durable archive and native-flush barriers remain in "
"force. Public sandbox model imports through `chat_sandbox` continue to "
"work."
msgstr ""
"`chat_sandbox_models.py` "
"里放的是保留容器的规格、检查和状态值、归属标签，以及身份字段的上下限。沙箱组的网桥、中继成员关系、Kata guest "
"路由同步，以及网络的证明和释放，都放在单独拆出来的 `chat_sandbox_network.py` "
"组件里。这个组件只依赖一个很窄的容器协议；精确的容器身份、有限制的 exec，以及出错就停的操作仍然由 manager 负责。manager "
"原有的网络入口都转交给这个组件处理。网络快照仍只在一次操作内有效，运维日志的名称保持不变。`chat_sandbox.py` "
"管理保留的沙箱组和组内成员；容器和进程之间的边界归 `sandbox.py`。原生会话和工作区操作由 Sandbox Manager 和会话 "
"supervisor 共同协调。supervisor 的元数据锁只保护内存里的归属关系。停止、孤儿恢复和归档删除在动 Docker "
"或读写标记文件之前，会先占住这一个沙箱组的生命周期；拿到结果后，先重新核对组、成员、容器和生命周期的身份，核对通过才采纳。其他沙箱组不受影响。核对失败会释放临时占用，但持久的归档屏障和原生刷新屏障依然有效。原来通过"
" `chat_sandbox` 导入公开沙箱模型的写法照样可用。"

