#: ../developer/code-structure.md:140
msgid ""
"Existing callers use `cloud_agent_host.runtimes`; the package explicitly "
"exports its public API. Runtime discovery facts live in the immutable "
"`cloud_agent_shared/runtime_catalog.py`, so the control plane advertises "
"runtime IDs, MCP support, and reasoning efforts without loading host "
"adapters. Runtime version pins remain in "
"`cloud_agent_shared/shared_protocol.py` and image files."
msgstr ""
"已有的调用方都通过 `cloud_agent_host.runtimes` 使用适配器，这个包会显式导出公开 API。运行时的发现信息放在不可变的"
" `cloud_agent_shared/runtime_catalog.py` 里，所以控制平面不用加载主机端的适配器，也能对外公布运行时 "
"ID、是否支持 MCP 和可选的推理强度。运行时的版本固定仍在 `cloud_agent_shared/shared_protocol.py` "
"和镜像文件里。"

