msgstr "共用的操作性能剖析"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:148
msgid ""
"Producers continue to import `cloud_agent_shared.operation_profiling`. "
"The implementation is organized under `cloud_agent_shared/profiling/` by "
"schema, models, run parsing, policy, measurement collection, stage "
"observers, process context, export, and clock access. See the package's "
"[responsibility and contract "
"guide](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/profiling/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"产生剖析数据的代码照旧导入 `cloud_agent_shared.operation_profiling`。具体实现放在 "
"`cloud_agent_shared/profiling/` 下，按 "
"schema、模型、运行解析、策略、测量采集、阶段观察器、进程上下文、导出和时钟访问分成几个模块。详见这个包的[职责与契约说明](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/profiling/README.md)。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:154
msgid ""
"The facade keeps the existing producer API and operational diagnostics. "
"Clock access respects its replaceable `time` object, keeping "
"deterministic tests and the default-off path intact. New profiling logic "
"belongs in its concern module instead of expanding the facade."
msgstr ""
"门面保留了原有的 API 和运维诊断功能。时钟访问会用它那个可替换的 `time` "
"对象，所以测试结果仍然确定，默认关闭的路径也不受影响。新的剖析逻辑放进对应的模块里，不要往门面里堆。"

