#: ../developer/code-structure.md:161
msgid ""
"Next.js route files live under `apps/frontend/src/app/`. Shared feature "
"UI lives under `components/features/` (`agents` for tasks and "
"conversations, `settings` for the settings pages, `teams`, `profile` and "
"`auth`), reusable presentation components under `components/`, and "
"browser utilities and API clients under `lib/`. Server-only integrations "
"belong in the existing server modules; a browser component must not pull "
"server credentials into its import graph."
msgstr ""
"Next.js 的路由文件在 `apps/frontend/src/app/` 下。各功能共用的界面在 "
"`components/features/` 下：`agents` 是任务和对话，`settings` 是设置页面，另外还有 "
"`teams`、`profile` 和 `auth`。可复用的展示组件在 `components/` 下，浏览器端的工具函数和 API 客户端在 "
"`lib/` 下。只能在服务端运行的集成放在现有的服务端模块里；浏览器组件的导入链里绝不能带进服务端凭据。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:169
msgid ""
"`lib/api/agents.ts` is the explicit public API facade. It delegates to "
"focused modules under `lib/api/agents/`: jobs, threads, sessions, goals, "
"configuration, integrations, resource and usage reads, workspace files, "
"terminals, and event streams. Shared create/Fork idempotency response "
"handling stays private to that package. Keep endpoint paths, retries, "
"credentials, cursor handling, and notifications with their owning "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"`lib/api/agents.ts` 是显式的公开 API 门面，具体工作交给 `lib/api/agents/` "
"下各管一摊的模块：任务、对话、会话、目标、配置、集成、资源和用量查询、工作区文件、终端和事件流。创建和 Fork "
"共用的幂等响应处理只在这个包内部使用。端点路径、重试、凭据、游标处理和通知，都跟着它所属的那个操作放。"

