#: ../developer/code-structure.md:190
msgid ""
"Keep state with the concern that owns it. Retained panels preserve "
"terminals, file previews, and drafts while hidden; scope changes must "
"reset the relevant state. Keep hooks' dependencies explicit and preserve "
"lazy loading when extracting components."
msgstr ""
"状态放在负责它的那一块里。保留的面板在隐藏时也会留住终端、文件预览和草稿；切换作用范围时，必须把相关状态重置掉。拆组件时，hook "
"的依赖要写明，延迟加载也要保留。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:195
msgid "Add a feature without losing the structure"
msgstr "加功能时别把结构弄乱"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:197
msgid ""
"Identify the service and concern that owns the behavior using the maps "
"above."
msgstr "对照上面的几张表，确定这项行为归哪个服务、哪一块负责。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:198
msgid ""
"Add or update its domain rule, wire model, and port only where the "
"behavior requires them. Implement durable operations inside storage."
msgstr "领域规则、传输模型和 port，确实需要时才新增或修改。持久化操作在 storage 里实现。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:200
msgid ""
"Put orchestration in an application flow or owning service, then call it "
"from the HTTP adapter or worker. Wire new resources through bootstrap."
msgstr "编排逻辑放在应用流程或负责它的服务里，再由 HTTP 适配器或 worker 去调用。新的资源通过 bootstrap 接入。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:202
msgid ""
"Add public facade exports deliberately. Import implementation modules "
"directly within a package to keep its dependency graph clear."
msgstr "门面的公开导出要想清楚再加。包内部直接导入实现模块，这样依赖关系一目了然。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:204
msgid ""
"Exercise observable behavior and affected boundaries. For structural "
"refactors, compare contracts and reuse existing behavioral tests."
msgstr "测试要覆盖外部可观察的行为和受影响的边界。做结构性重构时，比对前后的契约，并复用已有的行为测试。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:206
msgid ""
"Run the relevant complete gates and update the maintained guide for "
"changed ownership, commands, or behavior."
msgstr "跑完相关的完整检查；如果职责归属、命令或行为变了，就更新对应的维护中指南。"

#: ../developer/code-structure.md:209
msgid ""
"Backend architecture checks enforce service-image independence, API "
"import direction, domain/port independence, and repository isolation. "
"Backend imports must use the installed package names (`cloud_agent`, "
"`cloud_agent_host`, and `cloud_agent_shared`), rather than the checkout "
"namespace `apps.backend`. The host image flattens these packages, so "
"checkout-prefixed imports can work locally and fail after deployment; the"
" guards reject them in all three packages. The import scanners include "
"relative imports, imports inside functions, and `TYPE_CHECKING` blocks. "
"Backend behavior tests remain under `tests/`; frontend tests remain "
"alongside the feature or utility they exercise."
msgstr ""
"后端的架构检查会确保：服务镜像彼此独立、API 的导入方向正确、domain 和 port 不依赖其他层、repository "
"被隔离。后端导入必须用安装后的包名（`cloud_agent`、`cloud_agent_host` 和 "
"`cloud_agent_shared`），不能用仓库里的命名空间 "
"`apps.backend`。主机镜像会把这些包展平，带仓库前缀的导入在本地也许能用，部署后就会失败，所以三个包里都会拦下这种写法。导入扫描会覆盖相对导入、函数内部的导入和"
" `TYPE_CHECKING` 块。后端的行为测试放在 `tests/` 下；前端测试和它测试的功能或工具函数放在一起。"

